{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43272","headline":"闰月定四时 · 乐伸","name":"闰月定四时","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"圣代承尧历，恒将闰正时。\n六旬余可借，四序应如期。\n分至宁愆素，盈虚信不欺。\n斗杓重指甲，灰琯再推离。\n羲氏兼和氏，行之又则之。\n愿言符大化，永永作元龟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"乐伸","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43272.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43272","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}